					"nextDialogs": [
						737140102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 737140102,
					"content": "First stop, the desert oasis! Then we'll head through Mawtiyima Forest, and after that, back to Bayda Harbor!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737140103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 737140103,
					"content": "Paimon's been thinking about this... The desert, forest, and valleys in Sumeru all feel super different! But we've pretty much never seen them all in one trip, have we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737140104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 737140104,
					"content": "Good thing we don't have to rush this time. Paimon says we should take it nice and slow and soak it all in!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737140105,
						737140106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
